nmodel of the Indus script. Proceedings of the National \nAcademy of Sciences 106: 13685-13690.\nWells, B. K. 2012. Epigraphic Approaches to Indus Writing. \nCambridge, MA, Oxbow Press.\nWells, B. K. 2015. The Archaeology and Epigraphy of Indus \nWriting. Oxford, Archaeopress.\nYadav, N., Joglekar, H., Rao, R. P. N., Vahia M. N., Adhikari \nR. and Mahadevan I. 2010. Statistical analysis of the\nIndus script using n-grams. PLoS One 5(3):e9506."
